%% title: Sanctions Screening Flow
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Caller<br/>(payment-svc, kyc-svc)
  participant S as sanctions-service
  participant L as SanctionsList<br/>(EU/OFAC/UN cache)
  participant Out as Outbox
  participant K as Kafka<br/>sanctions.events

  C->>S: POST /api/v1/sanctions/screen<br/>{name, dateOfBirth, country}
  S->>L: lookup name against<br/>current list versions
  alt Match found
    L-->>S: hit (riskScore, listSource, matchedAlias)
    S->>Out: write SanctionsHit event
    S-->>C: 200 OK<br/>{outcome: HIT, riskScore, evidence}
  else No match
    L-->>S: clear
    S-->>C: 200 OK<br/>{outcome: CLEAR}
  end

  Out->>K: publish sanctions.hit.v1<br/>(every 500ms)
  K->>K: fan-out to consumers<br/>(audit, fraud, compliance UI)
